{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜消委會發表可持續消費追蹤研究報告／引進辦舉辦重點企業簽署儀式\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261022.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】消費者委員會今日(10月22日)發表第三份可持續消費追蹤研究報告。另外，引進重點企業辦公室舉辦重點企業簽署儀式，財政司司長陳茂波等官員出席儀式。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:34.248773+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:47:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T21:58:08.169125+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:10.686698+00:00","content_hash":"bbc84983b1a63ecb0df4f3dfba01f40791a1f7529097f160b4129e294966b259","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}